@title 3D heat: one Flow control, a calm default, a speed key in m/s and the through-flow verdict
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The hot cabinet with four grilles (qa/fixtures/make_vents_fixtures.py). After the run the Heat strip has the Flow control (Streamlines by default when there are openings), a speed key from 0 to the top in m/s with words, and a through-flow line with its verdict. The pictures are the evidence (drawn text and colour); the finished run is checked.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-vents-four-grilles.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 170
expect_not "Locked while the run goes"
expect "Through-flow"
shot 01-streamlines-calm
check_layout
check_blank 01-streamlines-calm
click_text Streamlines
click_text "Speed map"
wait 10
shot 02-speed-map
click_text "Speed map"
click_text Arrows
wait 10
shot 03-arrows
check_layout
